Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.50,0:00:06.55,Sp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(280,280)}I have a daughter now, I'm happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.14,0:00:09.90,Sp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(280,280)}I didn't lose a son, I gained a daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.98,0:00:12.40,Sp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(280,280)}She's the greatest.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.66,0:01:04.20,Sp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(280,280)}I love the way I feel when I'm with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.26,0:01:08.35,Sp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(280,280)}Like an elevated and better version of my truest self.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.42,0:01:12.05,Sp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(280,280)}I love your competitive, adventure-seeking spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.14,0:01:15.70,Sp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(280,280)}I love how you challenge me — but never let me win.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.78,0:01:19.20,Sp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(280,280)}I love how you make me laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.97,0:02:14.37,Sp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(280,280)}So with that energy, right here in this moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.47,0:02:17.07,Sp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(280,280)}I want to call on the highest power of love from above
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.15,0:02:19.97,Sp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(280,280)}to bless these two on their special day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.07,0:02:21.97,Sp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(280,280)}Because their love is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.20,0:02:25.35,Sp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(280,280)}So Tim, Allison — you're a movement by yourselves,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.43,0:02:27.70,Sp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(280,280)}but you're a force when you're together.
